Archive formats
  ID       NAME             LIST  EXTRACT CREATE ENCRYPT  RANDOM  EXTENSIONS
  zip      ZIP              yes   yes     yes    yes      yes     .zip .cbz .jar .war .apk .aab .ipa .xpi .vsix .nupkg .whl .docx .xlsx .pptx .odt .ods .odp .epub .appx .msix
  tar      TAR              yes   yes     yes    -        yes     .tar
  7z       7z               yes   yes     yes    yes      -       .7z .cb7
  rar      RAR              yes   yes     -      -        -       .rar .cbr .r00
  cpio     cpio             yes   yes     yes    -        yes     .cpio
  deb      Debian package   yes   yes     -      -        -       .deb .udeb
  ar       ar               yes   yes     yes    -        yes     .ar
  rpm      RPM package      yes   yes     -      -        -       .rpm
  cab      Cabinet          yes   yes     yes    -        -       .cab
  lzh      LHA              yes   yes     -      -        yes     .lzh .lha
  stream   compressed file  yes   yes     -      -        -       
  zip methods: store, deflate (1-9, 6), bzip2 (1-9, 9), zstd (1-22, 3), xz (0-9, 6), ppmd (1-9, 7)
  7z methods: lzma2 (0-9, 5), lzma (0-9, 5), ppmd (1-9, 6), bzip2 (1-9, 9), deflate (1-9, 6), copy
  cab methods: store, mszip

Codecs
  ID       NAME               LEVELS       THREADS  EXTENSIONS
  gzip     gzip               0-9 (6)      -        .gz .tgz
  zlib     zlib               0-9 (6)      -        .zz .zlib
  deflate  raw deflate        0-9 (6)      -        (never detected)
  bzip2    bzip2              1-9 (9)      -        .bz2 .tbz .tbz2
  xz       xz                 0-9 (6)      yes      .xz .txz
  lzma     LZMA (lzma-alone)  0-9 (6)      -        .lzma
  lzip     lzip               0-9 (6)      yes      .lz .tlz
  zstd     Zstandard          1-22 (3)     yes      .zst .tzst .zstd
  lz4      LZ4 frame          -            -        .lz4
  brotli   Brotli             0-11 (9)     -        .br
  snappy   Snappy (framed)    -            -        .sz
  compress Unix compress (.Z) -            -        .z .taz
  lzop     lzop               -            -        .lzo .tzo

